  "title": "Hard-Boiled Egg Casserole",
  "description": "Try this hard-boiled egg casserole made with eggs, spices, half-and-half, and two types of cheese. It may seem unusual, but it&#39;s delicious and filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Mary Shawhan"
